warning
# TIS-CW-6: issues labelled `model:<tier>` launched on the normal chain because the
# chain could not serve the tier: `no_entry` (no entry of that family is
# configured), `restricted` (every such entry is quota-restricted) or
# `conflicting_labels` (two tiers on one issue). The launch still happened;
# the warning is the signal that a requested family is missing or exhausted.
